90
00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:06.460
Success Metrics. You'll know it's working when four numbers are right: two hundred and eighty million plus verified participants

91
00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:15.800
(the three point five percent threshold), cost per verified participant under one dollar, viral coefficient above one point

92
