95
00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:41.040
Nobody has built this before. This is the most surprising part.

96
00:10:42.560 --> 00:10:50.440
On Why three point five percent Is The Magic Number. The two hundred and eighty million target is based on the "three point

97
00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:59.080
five percent Rule": when three point five percent of a population actively participates in sustained, nonviolent action,

98
00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:05.360
the movement has historically won. Every time so far. Across all cultures.

99
00:11:05.740 --> 00:11:13.720
For centuries. This is the closest thing your species has to a cheat code, and nobody teaches it in school, because teaching

100
